{"root":"sali","ipa":"/sa.li/","core":"指代一种在特定文化或宗教语境下，用于祈祷、礼拜或特定仪式中的行为或物品，通常与伊斯兰教的礼拜（salat）相关联，但在印尼语中作为借词或变体使用。","pos":["名词","动词"],"scenes":["教会","生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/sa.li/","zh":"礼拜；祈祷；进行宗教仪式。","phrases":[{"t":"sali berjamaah","zh":"集体礼拜"},{"t":"waktu sali","zh":"礼拜时间"},{"t":"tempat sali","zh":"礼拜场所"}],"examples":[{"t":"Mereka berkumpul untuk sali bersama.","zh":"他们聚集在一起进行礼拜。"},{"t":"Jangan lupa untuk sali tepat pada waktunya.","zh":"别忘了按时进行礼拜。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"sali","ipa":"/sa.li/","zh":"礼拜；祈祷。","phrase":{"t":"sali wajib","zh":"必须进行的礼拜"},"example":{"t":"Dia sedang sali di kamar.","zh":"他正在房间里做礼拜。"}},{"w":"bersali","ipa":"/bər.sa.li/","zh":"进行礼拜活动。","phrase":{"t":"sedang bersali","zh":"正在进行礼拜"},"example":{"t":"Ayah sedang bersali di masjid.","zh":"父亲正在清真寺里进行礼拜。"}},{"w":"penyalian","ipa":"/pə.ɲa.li.an/","zh":"礼拜的过程或仪式。","phrase":{"t":"tata cara penyalian","zh":"礼拜的仪式流程"},"example":{"t":"Penyalian itu berlangsung dengan khidmat.","zh":"那场礼拜仪式进行得非常庄重。"}}],"derSlugs":["sali","bersali","penyalian"],"model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-28T09:02:04.644Z","src":"base"}